[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584398\">1044B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584506\">1080C24</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584493\">1060F50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts securing the vacuum reservoir.</p><p>2. Disconnect the vacuum pipes from the vacuum reservoir.</p><p>3. Remove the vacuum reservoir.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021817.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the vacuum pipes to the vacuum\nreservoir.</p><p>Refit the vacuum reservoir in its seating\nand fix it with the nuts.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584493\">1060F50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584506\">1080C24</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584398\">1044B10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]